      "canonical_latex": "f_Z(x) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}} e^{-x^2 / 2} \\implies \\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} f_Z(x)\\,dx = 1,\\quad \\varphi_Z(t) = \\mathbb{E}[e^{i t Z}] = e^{-t^2 / 2}",
