      "canonical_latex": "\\forall t \\in \\mathbb{R},\\; \\lim_{n \\to \\infty} \\varphi_{X_n}(t) = \\varphi_X(t)\\;(\\text{continuous at } t=0) \\iff X_n \\xrightarrow{d} X",
